<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The replacement leader has already written a newer value. The old leader wakes after a long pause and sends a delayed write to a destination that may not know leadership changed.</p>

<!-- @before Leader Election :: animation -->
### Enforce ownership where the effect lands

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="A stale owner reaches the resource">
<h3>Walkthrough 1. A stale owner reaches the resource</h3><p class="pb-sub">Illustrative fencing contract. The resource atomically validates a monotonically increasing epoch with each protected write.</p>
