<!-- @before Replication Lag :: guide -->
### A leader election does not refresh every read

After a successful write, the read path still needs the feature’s freshness promise. Persist and carry its consistency token where supported, or show pending state until the authority can confirm the result. Session identity and eligible replicas matter across failover. [Session guarantees](https://www.cs.cornell.edu/courses/cs734/2000FA/cached%20papers/SessionGuaranteesPDIS_1.html).

<!-- @before Staff Engineer Review Checklist :: staff -->
### Name the enforcing owner

A generation number protects only the destination that checks it. Do not infer external fencing from a worker being cancelled or a lease expiring. [Chubby’s sequencers](https://research.google.com/archive/chubby-osdi06.pdf) illustrate making stale ownership detectable to the protected service.
